  "summary": "Every numerical value recovered from the publisher's supplementary document for Ganjave et al. (2022). It is one table of kLa measurements. It is NOT a time course.",
  "target_not_recovered": {
    "goal": "numerical time courses underlying Figure 3a (dissolved oxygen) and Figure 3b (biomass) of the held-out validation experiment (PDGF, 20 % glycerol, 30 % yeast extract, 0.78 mL/h)",
    "status": "NOT PUBLISHED",
    "evidence": [
      "The article carries no Data Availability statement and names no repository (checked in the PDF text layer and the PMC full text).",
      "The publisher lists exactly one supplementary file, mmc1.docx.",
      "mmc1.docx contains no spreadsheet, CSV, or embedded data part; its only tables are S1 (protein identities), S3 (optimisation bounds) and S4 (kLa).",
      "The two native charts in mmc1.docx are kLa determination plots with no cached numeric values.",
      "PMC and Europe PMC expose no dataset links for the article.",
      "No repository deposit (Zenodo, figshare, GitHub, Mendeley Data, Dryad) was found for the DOI or the authors."
    ]
  },
